@startuml
title Sơ đồ tuần tự - Ký hợp đồng điện tử

actor "Người thuê" as Tenant
actor "Chủ trọ" as Landlord
participant "Client" as Client
participant "ContractController" as ContractController
participant "Cloudinary" as Cloudinary
participant "PDFService" as PDFService
participant "EmailService" as EmailService
participant "NotificationService" as NotificationService
database "Contract" as ContractDB

Tenant -> Client: Ký hợp đồng
Client -> ContractController: POST /api/contracts/sign-tenant
ContractController -> ContractDB: Tìm hợp đồng
alt waiting_tenant_signature
    ContractController -> Cloudinary: Upload chữ ký người thuê
    Cloudinary --> ContractController: tenantSignatureUrl
    ContractController -> ContractDB: Lưu chữ ký, status = waiting_landlord_signature
    ContractController -> EmailService: Báo chủ trọ cần ký
    ContractController -> NotificationService: Thông báo cho chủ trọ
    ContractController --> Client: Người thuê ký thành công
else Không được phép ký
    ContractController --> Client: Báo lỗi
end

Landlord -> Client: Ký hợp đồng
Client -> ContractController: POST /api/contracts/sign-landlord
ContractController -> ContractDB: Tìm hợp đồng
alt waiting_landlord_signature
    ContractController -> Cloudinary: Upload chữ ký chủ trọ
    Cloudinary --> ContractController: landlordSignatureUrl
    ContractController -> ContractDB: Lưu chữ ký chủ trọ
    ContractController -> PDFService: Sinh PDF hợp đồng
    PDFService --> ContractController: PDF buffer
    ContractController -> Cloudinary: Upload PDF
    Cloudinary --> ContractController: pdfUrl
    ContractController -> ContractDB: status = active, lưu pdfUrl
    ContractController -> EmailService: Gửi PDF cho hai bên
    ContractController -> NotificationService: Thông báo hợp đồng hoàn tất
    ContractController --> Client: Hợp đồng có hiệu lực
else Không được phép ký
    ContractController --> Client: Báo lỗi
end

@enduml
